'''Mon-Hella''' was a location on the same [[Unidentified astronomical object (Ahsoka Tano)|astronomical object]] as a [[Unidentified farm village|farming village]]. During the [[Imperial Era]], [[farmer]]s in the village delivered their harvests to Mon-Hella. Former [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[Unidentified village sister|one]] of her co-workers were not present during the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Inquisitor]], [[Eleventh Brother]]'s [[Attack on a farm village|attack]] on the village because they were making a delivery to Mon-Hella. During that delivery, the two young women were forced to sell their delivery at lower prices than normal.<ref name="Resolve" />

